# Kanban inquiry cards

When a feature file has frontmatter `labels` including **`inquiry`** (case-insensitive), follow [kanban-markdown/SKILL.md](../skills/kanban-markdown/SKILL.md) § Inquiry cards.

## User provides

- `## Description` (required)
- `## Feature Areas` (optional — omit when not about an existing product area)

## Agent provides

- `## Response` — answer the question; include **Suggested follow-up cards** when applicable
- `## Label Paths` — when user provided **Feature Areas**, or when inferred during research
- `## Label Methods` — when **Feature Areas** set; symbols from research + registry `handlers`

## Spawn feature cards (mandatory when user asks)

When the user requests implementation of inquiry recommendations, spawn **todo** feature (or bug) cards per [kanban-markdown/SKILL.md](../skills/kanban-markdown/SKILL.md) § **Spawn feature cards from inquiry**:

- `status: "todo"`, `labels: []` (feature) or `["bug"]`
- `epic: "{EpicName}"` — PascalCase theme (e.g. `DesignFailureMemorySystem`, `GovernanceDriftAlerts`)
- Body sections: **Acceptance Criteria**, **Out of Scope**, **Feature Areas**, **Label Paths**, **Label Methods**, **Decisions**, **Context**
- Parent inquiry: **`## Spawned feature cards`** table + matching `epic`

Do **not** start implementation on spawned cards until user assigns work (pre-implementation review still applies).

## Workflow

1. Confirm **Description** present
2. Resolve **Feature Areas** → **Label Paths** + **Label Methods** when areas are set
3. `todo` → `in-progress` → research (read-only)
4. Write **Response** on the card → `review`
5. User asks to spawn → create **todo** child cards with `epic` + review-ready sections
6. User moves inquiry → `done` when satisfied

## Do not

- Use **Decisions**, **Corrective Action**, or **Acceptance Criteria** on the **inquiry** card itself
- Implement application code on the inquiry card unless user explicitly asks
- Spawn cards in **Backlog** — always **todo**
- Skip **Decisions** / **Label Paths** / **Label Methods** on spawned **feature** cards when Feature Areas are set
- Orbit / render **2D vs 3D parity** questions surfaced during bug QA → spawn **`inquiry`** card (not a bug on the parent unless AC contradicts shipped behavior); link from parent **Context** or handoff

